@startuml State_Transfer
title State Machine — Transfer Document (SM-03, Provisional)

' OBJECT  : SMO-03 Inventory Transaction Document — Transfer
' UC      : UC-19 Buat Draft transfer; UC-20 Post transfer
' FR      : FR-TRF-001, FR-TRF-002, FR-TRF-003, FR-TRF-004, FR-TRF-005, FR-AUD-004, FR-AUD-001
' RULE    : RULE-003, RULE-010, RULE-011, RULE-014, RULE-015, RULE-016, RULE-017, RULE-018, RULE-024, RULE-025, RULE-027
' DECISION: D-B04 Proposed, D-B15 Proposed, D-T06 Proposed
' CATATAN : Dua movement dalam satu transaksi. Total stok gabungan tidak berubah.

state "Draft" as Draft
state "Posted" as Posted

[*] --> Draft : Create [UC-19, nomor unik, asal dan tujuan berbeda serta aktif] / simpan baris, saldo kedua lokasi tetap

Draft --> Draft : Revise [masih Draft] / simpan ulang baris, saldo tetap

Draft --> Posted : Post [UC-20, permission, saldo asal cukup, serial di asal, masih Draft] / transaksi kurangi asal TRANSFER_OUT, tambah tujuan TRANSFER_IN, audit, COMMIT

Draft --> Draft : Post gagal [lokasi sama atau nonaktif, saldo kurang, total berubah, atau error] / ROLLBACK kedua movement

Posted --> Posted : Edit/Hapus [RULE-012] / tolak, dokumen utuh

Posted --> [*]

note right of Draft
  RULE-010: Draft tidak mengubah saldo.
  Transfer antar gudang bukan MVP.
end note

note right of Posted
  RULE-017: total gabungan tetap.
  Immutable; koreksi lewat SM-05.
end note

@enduml
